# Keep manager.sql

- Do not delete `graduation-project/manager.sql`.
- Do not empty, overwrite, or replace it during cleanup, tightening, or “unused file” passes.
- It is an early scaffold backup (admin / notice). Keep it as-is.
- Fresh installs still use `schema.sql` + `data.sql`. Do not tell the user to run `manager.sql` to create the current schema (it DROP-s tables).
